{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48bbce1d51d27cd0b9b126b4c242ffcc59b68828.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}\\frac{(125)(625)}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" /> is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b0369affc1484e1a096ee7809c2de4bc16b42689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 725\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3125\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48bbce1d51d27cd0b9b126b4c242ffcc59b68828.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}\\frac{(125)(625)}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" /> can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/540fdc9a0ccf2b3fb4275ef2cd70806826cf4efd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}\\ (125)(25)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/5/8b5c6d08c00588b3e5654befc75bcc736281dcc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25^2 = 625$\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/6404a740a9a341a346aca74ab205cbcd6f67b70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125 = 5^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b31bdf57c202bda35b77d630124399deab12b96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2 = 25$\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f291f7f8a360cdedfb71bbf15f08417453265b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}\\ 5^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"19\" /> would be the simplest form. In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f291f7f8a360cdedfb71bbf15f08417453265b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}\\ 5^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b24e699c77aa110d0746bed523b7da7d13ac8fc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^x = 5^5$\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd8ddf79c3f8c779303435d1bc7b1c36ba6af5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48bbce1d51d27cd0b9b126b4c242ffcc59b68828.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}\\frac{(125)(625)}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" /> can be also represented as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/1/8813d07a0f46923e783aea6b2a3accca79694d28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}\\frac{(5^3)(5^4)}{5^2}= \\log_{5}\\frac{(5^7)}{5^2}= \\log_{5} 5^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"265\" height=\"39\" /> which can be solved to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd8ddf79c3f8c779303435d1bc7b1c36ba6af5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_